// doors, the switches, the pickups (item, key, power-up, the IZh-58's), the
// lifts and moving floors, the teleporter. The CEO's verdict on
// work/audio/preview/world_sounds_listening.html (gen_world_sfx.py's 56
// candidates): 50 OK, installed byte for byte, and SDPLOOF_w1 laid over
// SDPLOOF_w3's impact as he asked; tools/audio/master_world_sfx.py
// (--sndinfo prints these lines), docs/sound/WORLD-SOUNDS.md. Files in
// assets/sounds/world/. The comment names the page's candidate.
