// How the engine reaches them (gzdoom.pk3 g4.14.2: sndinfo.txt and
// filter/game-doomchex/sndinfo.txt, read 2026-10-23):
//   * the world's: a $random group on the engine's OWN logical name
//     (doors/dr1_open, switches/normbutn, misc/i_pkup...), which redefines
//     the IWAD lump line; redefining a name keeps gzdoom.pk3's $limit 1 and
//     $pitchshift 0 on the pickups. Members <that name>/<take>, as above.
//     misc/k_pkup (keys) is its own group, its members on the item's lumps,
//     as Doom plays DSITEMUP for both (a take is in one group only).
//   * the player's: a $random group sd/player/<event>, and $playeralias
//     points the player sounds at it, for all three genders (the sergeant is
//     one man). Doom makes *pain75/50/25 and *land duplicates of *pain100
//     and *grunt, so each is aliased again, or it would keep DSPLPAIN/DSOOF
//     (and a hard landing would play both oofs).
//   * the IZh-58's: sd/weapon/izh/pickup, SD_Izh's Inventory.PickupSound.
// Still Freedoom's: the jump (*jump, DSJUMP: both takes NO), *gibbed
